OL,3,GNEWSABoom in butterflies at rewilded
OL,4,Abeauty spot
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rewilded beauty spot in West Sussex
OL,7,Fhas recorded a boom in butterfly
OL,8,Fnumbers, including two nationally
OL,9,Fimportant species that had never been
OL,10,Fseen before at the site.
OL,12,FHalnaker Hill Farm near Chichester
OL,13,Frecorded 5,290 butterflies from 28
OL,14,Fdifferent species, including the dingy
OL,15,Fskipper and the UK's tiniest butterfly,
OL,16,Fthe small blue.
OL,18,FOver the past two years, 330 acres (134
OL,19,Fhectares) of land that had been
OL,20,Fintensively farmed has been allowed to
OL,21,Freturn to nature.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
